 available, `model_missing` when the reason says the model is not loaded and `unreachable` otherwise. Set `laneEnabled` to false unless `reachable`. A non-Ollama backend gets `probe_not_implemented`. Keep `readAdvisorStatus` synchronous (`$ADV/handlers/advisor-status.ts`). Verify: `npm --prefix $ADV run typecheck` exits 0 and in `$ADV` `npx vitest run tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts` reports 0 failed. The live value is checked in T042.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"^- \\\\[ \\\\] T017 \",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/tasks.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794535002210,"end":1794535003151}}}}
