{"type":"text","timestamp":1794535242424,"sessionID":"ses_e2d61a62bffegfNufwY5ePpj5d","part":{"id":"prt_1d2a2ad38002IQFD97NZ3QM9mG","sessionID":"ses_e2d61a62bffegfNufwY5ePpj5d","messageID":"msg_1d2a299c5001694uANgzaNrojU","type":"text","text":"T017 implemented.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-status.ts`\n  - Imports `getManifest` from `../lib/embedders/registry.js` and `probeOllamaModel` / `resolveOllamaBaseUrl` from `../lib/embedders/adapters/ollama.js`.\n  - Adds `probeSemanticLaneBackend(health)`: resolves the active manifest from `semanticLaneHealth.activeEmbedder.name`, returns `probe_not_implemented` with `laneEnabled: false` for a non-Ollama backend, otherwise awaits `probeOllamaModel(resolveOllamaBaseUrl(), manifest.ollamaName ?? manifest.name, 500)`. `reachable` leaves the computed `laneEnabled`; `model_missing` when the probe reason says the model is not loaded, `unreachable` otherwise, and both set `laneEnabled: false`. No active embedder means no manifest, so `backend` is omitted.\n  - `handleAdvisorStatus` applies the probe only when `includeSemanticHealth` is true. `readAdvisorStatus` and `readSemanticLaneHealth` remain synchronous.\n\n**Verify output**\n```\n$ npm --prefix .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime run typecheck\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\nEXIT:0\n```\n```\n$ (in .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime) npx vitest run tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  22 passed (22)\nEXIT:0\n```\n\n**Not done, by design**\n- Did not tick the checkbox in `tasks.md`.\n- Did not run the live `advisor_status` check: the CLI shim runs `dist/`, which is stale and not rebuilt by this task. The live value is T042's check, and the T017 probe states are covered by T022's mocked cases.\n- No test file was edited.","time":{"start":1794535238968,"end":1794535242424}}}
